>>
endobj
1210 0 obj
<<
/Title (Fluent Validation Pipelines: All incoming POST body models are automatically intercepted and validated using FluentValidation, short-circuiting malformed requests early and returning standardised ProblemDetails error formats.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1193 0 R
/Prev 1209 0 R
/Next 1201 0 R
>>
endobj
1211 0 obj
<<
/Title (Architectural Segregation: The system will transition to the CQRS pattern, completely separating data modification writes \(Commands\) from read-only data fetches \(Queries\).)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1202 0 R
/Next 1217 0 R
>>
endobj
1212 0 obj
<<
/Title (Optimized Performance & Scaling: By decoupling the read and write pipelines, the API can scale data retrieval pathways independently, laying the groundwork for high-throughput, near real-time agent tracking and logging operations.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1202 0 R
/Prev 1217 0 R
>>
